  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.1">
<l>tuppuṭai yārai yaṭaiva tellām</l>
<l rend="indent">cōrviṭat tuttuṇai yāva reṉṟē</l>
<l>oppilē ṉākilum niṉṉa ṭaintēṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">āṉaikku nīyaruḷ ceyta maiyāl</l>
<l>eyppeṉṉai vantuna liyum pōtaṅ</l>
<l rend="indent">kētumnā ṉuṉṉaini ṉaikka māṭṭēṉ</l>
<l>appōtaik kippōtē colli vaittēṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Is it not the case that resorting to one who has strength</l>
<l rend="indent">[means that] he will provide protection from all weaknesses?</l>
<l>Even though I am not worthy, I have taken refuge in you</l>
<l rend="indent">because you granted [your] grace to the elephant.</l>
<l>When suffering comes to me, exhausted,</l>
<l rend="indent">I will not be able to think even one thing about you.</l>
<l>I have spoken now for that time,</l>
<l rend="indent">Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
